## Documentation and project-authored assets

Project-authored documentation and non-brand assets in this repository are
available under the same `MIT OR Apache-2.0` choice unless a file or directory
states different terms.

## Brand exclusion

Ocean names, logos, wordmarks, application icons derived from the Ocean mark,
and other distinctive brand assets are not licensed under the open-source
licenses above. Reasonable nominative use remains allowed as described in
[`TRADEMARKS.md`](TRADEMARKS.md). Source code surrounding or generating a brand
asset remains under the project license; the resulting brand identity does not.

## Third-party material

Third-party code, fonts, and icons remain under their respective licenses. See
[`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md), [`docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md`](docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md),
local license files, source headers, and dependency manifests. Those terms
continue to apply regardless of which Ocean license you select.

Unless required by an upstream license or agreed in writing, contributions
submitted to this repository are licensed under this same project licensing
posture.
